WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
RBC-RT: Wanted to share our read on CAD rates positioning heading into next week's central bank meeting.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Grace: Appreciate it, what are you seeing on the positioning side?

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
RBC-RT: Market looks fairly balanced, no strong consensus lean either way on the next move.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Grace: That matches our read too, a lot of the desks we talk to are staying neutral for now.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
RBC-RT: Right, feels like everyone is waiting for the next inflation print before committing to a direction.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Grace: Makes sense, we are in a similar wait and see mode ourselves.

7
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
RBC-RT: Fair enough, we will keep sharing colour as positioning shifts closer to the meeting.

8
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Grace: Appreciated, always useful to compare notes before a central bank decision.

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
RBC-RT: Agreed, talk again before the meeting.
